# Task Workflow

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/agent-workflow.md`.
Use **one bounded task → explicit acceptance criteria → implementation → executable checks → review → handoff**.
Keep detailed context in the task record, not in always-on rules.
Do not restart approval for already authorized work or claim checks passed without evidence.
